45 Q 890 4205 1325 4505 Q 1760 4806 2362 4806 L 2362 4806 z\nM 2259 2387 Q 2093 2387 1885 2345 Q 1677 2304 1491 2240 Q 1306 2176 1171 2093 Q 1094 2042 1068 1987 Q 1043 1933 1043 1818 Q 1043 1587 1116 1340 Q 1190 1094 1334 876 Q 1478 659 1702 524 Q 1926 390 2234 390 Q 2534 390 2768 524 Q 3002 659 3139 896 Q 3277 1133 3277 1421 Q 3277 1690 3155 1910 Q 3034 2131 2803 2259 Q 2573 2387 2259 2387 L 2259 2387 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-81\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-86\" transform=\"translate(46.5 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(112.59375 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_13\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(171.4721 75.648) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-81\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\" transform=\"translate(46.5 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(106.40625 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_14\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(253.5014 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><defs><path id=\"LibreFranklin-Regular-84\" d=\"M 2470 4678 Q 2502 4717 2534 4733 Q 2566 4749 2630 4749 L 3059 4749 Q 3136 4749 3136 4672 L 3136 1792 Q 3136 1734 3187 1734 L 3789 1734 Q 3878 1734 3878 1670 L 3878 1357 Q 3878 1274 3789 1274 L 3194 1274 Q 3136 1274 3136 1210 L 3136 96 Q 3136 0 3034 0 L 2598 0 Q 2515 0 2515 83 L 2515 1229 Q 2515 1274 2458 1274 L 384 1274 Q 288 1274 288 1357 L 288 1683 Q 288 1728 313 1776 Q 339 1824 390 1894 L 2470 4678 L 2470 4678 z\nM 2445 1734 Q 2502 1734 2502 1779 L 2502 3910 Q 2502 3987 2483 3993 Q 2464 4000 2413 3936 L 851 1818 Q 787 1734 896 1734 L 2445 1734 z\n\" transform=\"scale(0.015625)\"/></defs><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\" transform=\"translate(59.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(124.8125 0)\"/></g></g><g id=\"text_15\"><g style=\"fill: #333333\" transform=\"translate(336.26695 14.928) scale(0.08 -0.08)\"><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-82\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-84\" transform=\"translate(59.90625 0)\"/><use xlink:href=\"#LibreFranklin-Regular-80\" transform=\"translate(124.8125 0)\"/></g></g></g></g><defs><clipPath id=\"p3d66581f27\"><rect x=\"46.883\" y=\"10.824\" width=\"345.96\" height=\"127.512\"/></clipPath></defs></svg>\n","title":"Exhibit 1 · People per hour by station","note":null},"answer":"<p>Check-in: 4 × 60 ÷ 1.5 = 160. Screening: 6 × 60 ÷ 3 = <b>120</b>. Vaccination: 8 × 30 = 240. Observation: 60 chairs × 4 an hour = 240.</p> <p><b>Screening is the bottleneck</b> at 120 an hour.</p>"},{"q":"The manager wants more screening nurses. How many would be needed, and is there a cheaper way?","exhibit":null,"answer":"<p>For 200 an hour at 3 minutes each: 200 × 3 ÷ 60 = <b>10 nurses</b>, 4 more.</p> <p>Cheaper: ask people to complete health questions online. Average screening time: 70% × 1 + 30% × 3 = 1.6 minutes, so 6 nurses screen 225 an hour.</p> <p>But now <b>check-in (160 an hour) is the bottleneck</b>.</p>"},{"q":"How do you get to 200?","exhibit":{"kind":"table","headers":["Station","Today","+ online forms","+ one check-in desk"],"rows":[["Check-in","160","160","200"],["Screening","120","225","225"],["Vaccination","240","240","240"],["Observation","240","240","240"]],"title":"Exhibit 2 · Capacity per hour","note":null,"align":["l","r","r","r"],"boldLast":false},"answer":"<p>Add one check-in desk (5 desks: 200 an hour). Now every station handles at least 200: the slowest is check-in at 200.</p> <p>Total change: online forms plus one desk clerk, instead of four extra nurses. Check observation: at 200 an hour, 200 × 15 ÷ 60 = 50 people seated at once, within 60 chairs.</p>"}],"reco":"Reach 200 an hour by removing work rather than adding nurses. Screening limits the centre to 120 an hour; asking people to complete health questions online cuts screening time to about 1.6 minutes, lifting it to 225 an hour, and one extra check-in desk clears the next bottleneck, taking every station to at least 200. That needs one clerk instead of four extra nurses. Risk: fewer people complete forms online than expected, so keep two nurses on call. Next step: add the online form to the booking confirmation.","great":["Computes capacity for every station, including observation chairs","Finds the bottleneck and the next one","Prefers removing work to adding staff","Checks that every station meets the target"],"id":82,"slug":"lantern-vaccination-centre"}